  "footer.disclosure": {
    en: '<strong>Regulatory Disclosure:</strong> Nuvia Immigration Consulting is a private immigration consulting firm. Our Regulated Canadian Immigration Consultants (RCICs) are licensed by and in good standing with the College of Immigration and Citizenship Consultants (CICC). We are <strong>not</strong> affiliated with Immigration, Refugees and Citizenship Canada (IRCC) or any Canadian government department. RCIC License: <strong>R1040752</strong>. To verify a consultant\'s status, visit <a href="https://www.college-ic.ca" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">college-ic.ca</a>. To file a complaint, visit the CICC website or contact them directly.',
    fr: '<strong>Divulgation réglementaire :</strong> Nuvia Immigration Consulting est une firme privée de consultation en immigration. Nos consultants RCIC sont agréés et en règle auprès du Collège des consultants en immigration et en citoyenneté (CCIC). Nous ne sommes <strong>pas</strong> affiliés à Immigration, Réfugiés et Citoyenneté Canada (IRCC). Permis RCIC : <strong>R1040752</strong>. Vérifiez un consultant sur <a href="https://www.college-ic.ca" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">college-ic.ca</a>.',
    vi: '<strong>Công bố quy định:</strong> Nuvia Immigration Consulting là công ty tư vấn di trú tư nhân. Tư vấn viên RCIC của chúng tôi được cấp phép và tuân thủ CICC. Chúng tôi <strong>không</strong> liên kết với IRCC hay bất kỳ cơ quan chính phủ Canada nào. Giấy phép RCIC: <strong>R1040752</strong>. Xác minh tại <a href="https://www.college-ic.ca" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">college-ic.ca</a>.',
  },
